OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fpossible at times tonight, with
OL,7,Fclearer spells developing towards
OL,8,Fdawn, allowing temperatures to dip
OL,9,Fbelow freezing with a touch of frost
OL,10,Fin prone locations. Feeling chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FBright start to the week, with
OL,13,Fsunny spells developing, though
OL,14,Ffeeling chilly. Turning cloudier
OL,15,Fthrough the afternoon with rain and
OL,16,Fstrong winds to come into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
